# shell: desktop
# An agent must never learn about a dialog by staring at pixels: the
# collision question is a FACT, answered by name in both drivers --
# in-process from the overlay's state, conducted through the channel's
# "alert" noun.  Escape answers it, and the fact empties.
note copy a.txt onto sub, which already holds one of that name
press 200 117
move 200 110
move 200 97
release 200 97
wait 25
expect-alert exists
note Escape presses Cancel, which abandons the job and destroys nothing
key Escape
wait 15
quit
